flowchart LR
    U[User Question] --> R[Intent Router]
    R -->|knowledge| K[RAG Knowledge Retrieval]
    R -->|PO/SO/SKU/summary| T[Read-only ERP Tool API]
    R -->|uat| A[UAT Assistant]
    T --> Q[(SQLite / MySQL-compatible ERP Data Model)]
    T --> D[Rule Diagnosis]
    K --> S[Evidence-based Synthesis]
    D --> S
    A --> S
    S --> O[Conclusion + Evidence + Trace + Next Action]
